    "north": "/open/clan/13_luck/room/room93.lpc",
    "south": "/open/clan/13_luck/room/room91",
  ]));
  set("long", @LONG

    客官欢迎您来到烟雨楼八楼，您所定下的厢房已经清理干净了。
